{"addedOn":10,"avgRating":["fa fa-star-o","fa fa-star-o","fa fa-star-o","fa fa-star-o","fa fa-star-o"],"breadcrumbsHtml":"<a href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117\">OpenEdge Development: ABL Reference</a>\n<span><i class=\"fa fa-angle-right\"></i>\n</span>\n<a href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/ABL-Syntax-Reference.html\">ABL Syntax Reference</a>\n<span><i class=\"fa fa-angle-right\"></i>\n</span>\n<span class=\"active\">* Multiplication operator</span>\n","class":"manual","created":2879,"dislikeurl":"https://docs-be.progress.com/dislike/310091","html":"<article class=\"hascomments\" data-page=\"bundle:openedge-abl-reference-117/enus/Multiplication-operator.html\" id=\"bundle:openedge-abl-reference-117/enus/Multiplication-operator.html\"><main role=\"main\"><article aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\" class=\"dita\" id=\"Multiplication-operator\" role=\"article\">\n  <h1 class=\"title topictitle1 reference\" id=\"ariaid-title1\">* Multiplication operator</h1>\n  \n  <div class=\"body refbody\">\n    <section class=\"section\">\n      <p class=\"p\">Multiplies two numeric expressions.</p>\n    </section>\n    <section class=\"section\" id=\"Multiplication-operator__syntax_GC152O2679211\"><h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\" id=\"d377216e101\">Syntax</h2>\n      \n      <table class=\"table frame-all\" id=\"Multiplication-operator__idGDE1VO2661813\"><caption></caption><colgroup><col style=\"width:100%\" /></colgroup><tbody class=\"tbody\">\n            <tr class=\"row rowsep-0\">\n              <td class=\"entry colsep-1 rowsep-1\">\n                <pre class=\"pre codeblock\"><code><var class=\"keyword varname\">expression</var> * <var class=\"keyword varname\">expression</var></code></pre>\n              </td>\n            </tr>\n          </tbody></table>\n      <dl class=\"dl parml\">\n        \n          <dt class=\"dt pt dlterm\">\n            <var class=\"keyword varname\">expression</var>\n          </dt>\n          <dd class=\"dd pd\">An expression with a numeric value.</dd>\n        \n      </dl>\n    </section>\n    <section class=\"section\" id=\"Multiplication-operator__example_GC152P2679217\"><h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\" id=\"d377216e146\">Example</h2>\n      \n      <p class=\"p\">This\nprocedure computes the value of the on-hand inventory for each item. If\nthe on-hand inventory is negative, the procedure sets the inventory\nvalue to 0.</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">r-mult.p</p>\n      <table class=\"table frame-all\" id=\"Multiplication-operator__idGDE1VP2661818\"><caption></caption><colgroup><col style=\"width:100%\" /></colgroup><tbody class=\"tbody\">\n            <tr class=\"row rowsep-0\">\n              <td class=\"entry colsep-1 rowsep-1\">\n                <pre class=\"pre codeblock\"><code>DEFINE VARIABLE inv-value AS DECIMAL NO-UNDO LABEL &quot;VALUE&quot;.\n\nFOR EACH Item NO-LOCK:\n  <strong class=\"ph b\">inv-value = Item.OnHand * Item.Price.</strong>\n  IF inv-value &lt; 0 THEN\n    inv-value = 0.\n  DISPLAY Item.ItemNum Item.ItemName Item.OnHand Item.Price inv-value.\nEND.</code></pre>\n              </td>\n            </tr>\n          </tbody></table>\n    </section>\n    <section class=\"section\" id=\"Multiplication-operator__notes_GC152Q2679223\"><h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\" id=\"d377216e181\">Note</h2>\n      \n      <p class=\"p\">Multiplying\ntwo decimal expressions produces a DECIMAL value. Multiplying two\nINTEGER expressions produces an INTEGER value. Multiplying two INT64\nexpressions produces an INT64 value. Multiplying an integer expression\n(INTEGER or INT64) and a decimal expression produces a DECIMAL value.\nMultiplying an INTEGER expression and an INT64 expression produces\nan INT64 value.</p>\n    </section>\n    <section class=\"section\" id=\"Multiplication-operator__see-also_GC152R2679227\"><h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\" id=\"d377216e190\">See also</h2>\n      \n      <p class=\"p\">\n        <a class=\"xref\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"Division-operator.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/Division-operator.html#Division-operator\">/ Division operator</a>\n      </p>\n    </section>\n  </div>\n<nav role=\"navigation\"><div class=\"familylinks\"><div class=\"previouslink\"><strong>Previous topic:</strong> <a class=\"link\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"Datetime-subtraction-operator.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/Datetime-subtraction-operator.html\">- Datetime subtraction operator</a></div><div class=\"nextlink\"><strong>Next topic:</strong> <a class=\"link\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"Division-operator.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/Division-operator.html\">/ Division operator</a></div></div></nav><nav class=\"related-links\" role=\"navigation\"></nav></article></main></article>\n","isWatched":false,"labelText":"Product; Product > OpenEdge; Product > OpenEdge > Version 11.7; Format; Format > Documentation","likes":0,"likeurl":"https://docs-be.progress.com/like/310091","myDocsURL":null,"numOfPageViews":0,"numOfRatingsText":"<span>0 Ratings","revised":2879,"showWatch":false,"topicMeta":[["bookowner","oe11docs"],["bookrights","oe11docs"],["bundle","openedge-abl-reference-117"],["data","OEInformationHub/Product"],["data","OEInformationHub/Product/product_openedge"],["data","OEInformationHub/Product/product_openedge/product_openedge_117"],["data","OEInformationHub/format"],["data","OEInformationHub/format/format_documentation"],["organization","oe11docs"]],"topicTitle":"* Multiplication operator","topicurl":"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/Multiplication-operator.html","type":"Manual"}